### Library Management System - REST Client

### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = 

### ====== AUTH ENDPOINTS ======

### Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "testpass123"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

### ====== BOOK ENDPOINTS ======

### Get all books
GET {{baseUrl}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get book by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search books by title
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/search/title?title=Great
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search books by author
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/search/author?author=Tolkien
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search book by ISBN
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/search/isbn?isbn=9780547928227
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a new book (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Silmarillion",
  "author": "J.R.R. Tolkien",
  "isbn": "9780544003452",
  "available": true
}

### Update a book (Admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Great Gatsby - Updated",
  "author": "F. Scott Fitzgerald",
  "isbn": "9780743273565"
}

### Borrow a book
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1/borrow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Return a book
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/3/return
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Calculate fine for overdue book
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/5/fine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a book (Admin only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ====== DASHBOARD ENDPOINTS ======

### Get admin statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get my borrowed books
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/my-books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ====== SWAGGER UI ======
# Access OpenAPI documentation at:
# http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
